        Standard business hours in Moscow (9:00 AM to 6:00 PM MSK) correspond to <strong>6:00 AM to 3:00 PM GMT</strong>. The ideal overlap window for real-time meetings is between <strong>9:00 AM and 3:00 PM GMT (12:00 PM to 6:00 PM MSK)</strong>, providing 6 full working hours of simultaneous availability.
      </p>
      <h3>Best Practices for Scheduling</h3>
      <ul style="padding-left: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.9;">
